# Golden (Accompany, roadmap 9310, docs/design/orchestrator-pipeline-
# extraction.md §16.5/§16.7, phase4-execution-plan.md 4d): the 3-stage
# `[MIDI-source, chorddet, arrangrr]` pipeline end-to-end. `midi-source load`
# replays the shared `tiny.mid` fixture (96 PPQN, C4 then D4 on channel 0,
# one drum note on channel 9 -- also used by components/midisrc's and
# arrstyle-converter's own unit tests) on its own port (1), thru-scheduled
# into the SAME OutScheduler the band (port 0) uses -- one merged D29 total
# order, no transport needed (the melody-thru fires on stream time alone,
# exactly like a manual `play` does in every other golden).
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth:4
midi-source load components/midisrc/tests/fixtures/tiny.mid
@0 play D
@96 chord stop
advance 3000
quit
